 lead went straight back to Black at +14.1. Black took H3 next at no cost, and the game ended three moves later."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py prints group liberties, count.py tallies area score on a pasted board, and after.py applies one move the player names and reports captures and group liberties. None of them loops over empty points to rank moves or plays a sequence forward, so they only inspect the current position and the effect of a single named move.", "stop": false}}